"卸载 OpenSurge？" = "Uninstall OpenSurge?";
"OpenSurge App、用户级 Control Service 与 root Helper 都会被移除。\n\n“保留数据并卸载”会保留配置、订阅和策略数据，便于重新安装；“彻底卸载”还会删除凭据、运行记录和日志。当前系统的 IPv4 forwarding 状态不会被修改。" = "The OpenSurge app, user Control Service, and root Helper will be removed.\n\n“Keep Data and Uninstall” preserves configuration, subscriptions, and policy data for reinstallation. “Uninstall Completely” also removes credentials, runtime records, and logs. The current system IPv4 forwarding state will not be changed.";
