"退出只会关闭菜单栏图标；OpenSurge 后台控制服务仍会继续运行。当前无法确认网关服务状态，请先在 Web GUI 或活动监视器中检查。" = "This only closes the menu bar icon; the OpenSurge background control service will keep running. The gateway service state cannot be confirmed, so check the Web GUI or Activity Monitor first.";
"退出只会关闭菜单栏图标；正在运行的 DHCP/DNS、mihomo、PF/转发和后台控制服务都不会停止。请先在 Web GUI 中停止网关（如需要）。" = "This only closes the menu bar icon. Running DHCP/DNS, mihomo, PF/forwarding, and the background control service will not stop. Stop the gateway in the Web GUI first if needed.";
"退出只会关闭菜单栏图标；正在运行的 DHCP/DNS、mihomo、PF/转发和后台控制服务都不会停止。请先在 Web GUI 中停止网关（如需要）。 当前网络状态机尚未结束，退出也不会完成网络恢复。" = "This only closes the menu bar icon. Running DHCP/DNS, mihomo, PF/forwarding, and the background control service will not stop. Stop the gateway in the Web GUI first if needed. The network state machine is incomplete, and quitting will not complete recovery.";
"退出只会关闭菜单栏图标；网关当前未运行，但 OpenSurge 后台控制服务仍会继续运行。" = "This only closes the menu bar icon. The gateway is stopped, but the OpenSurge background control service will keep running.";
"当前无法确认网关服务状态。请先重新连接后台服务，确认网关与网络恢复状态后再退出 OpenSurge。" = "The gateway service state cannot be confirmed. Reconnect to the background service and confirm gateway and recovery state before quitting OpenSurge.";
"网络恢复尚未完成。请先在网络设置中完成恢复，再退出 OpenSurge。" = "Network recovery is incomplete. Complete it in Network Settings before quitting OpenSurge.";
"网关数据面仍在运行。请先在网络设置中停止网关，确认 DHCP/DNS、mihomo 与 PF 已停止。" = "The gateway data plane is still running. Stop the gateway in Network Settings and confirm DHCP/DNS, mihomo, and PF have stopped.";
"网关数据面已经停止。此操作会退出菜单栏 App 和用户级 Control Service；由系统 launchd 托管的 root Helper 仍保持空闲加载，下次打开 OpenSurge 不需要再次授权。" = "The gateway data plane is stopped. This quits the menu bar app and user Control Service; the launchd-managed root Helper remains loaded and idle, so reopening OpenSurge will not require authorization again.";
"当前无法确认网关状态。请先重新连接后台服务，再卸载 OpenSurge。" = "The gateway state cannot be confirmed. Reconnect to the background service before uninstalling OpenSurge.";
"网关仍在运行。请先在网络设置中停止网关，再卸载 OpenSurge。" = "The gateway is still running. Stop it in Network Settings before uninstalling OpenSurge.";
"网关已经停止。卸载不会修改当前系统的 IPv4 forwarding 状态。" = "The gateway is stopped. Uninstalling will not change the current system IPv4 forwarding state.";
